# Godmode private continuity and research state.
.godmode/
.godmode-private/
.godmode-state/
# I-6 (fix round 2, D2): a saved atlas index, refreshed by `godmode retest
# --run` (`godmode_closure.refresh_atlas_index`) - a machine-local cache a
# closure check rehydrates from, never a fact worth committing or reviewing.
.godmode-atlas-index.json
.research/
.planning/
.sprints/
.checkpoints/
.handovers/
.evidence/
.decisions/
.lessons/
/v*r*j.md

# Defensive private-record patterns.
**/*sprint*.md
**/*sprint*.json
**/*checkpoint*.md
**/*checkpoint*.json
**/*handover*.md
**/*handover*.json
**/*decision*.md
**/*decision*.json
**/*lesson*.md
**/*lesson*.json
**/task-plan.md
**/task_plan.md
**/STATE.md

# Generated files.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.coverage
coverage/
dist/
build/
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
docs-site/

# Host workspace state (worktree checkouts, agent scratch) - never shippable.
.claude/

# Agent task reports and SDD scratch - internal, never shippable.
.superpowers/

# B4-7 dogfood plant snapshot registry - exists only while DogfoodingTests
# run (or after a killed run, until the next run heals from it). Carries
# repo file contents, so it must never be committable by a `git add -A`
# that races a test run.
.dogfood-restore.json
.godmode-authorization-policy*.json

# Plugin eval run output.
quality/evals/results/
docs/superpowers/
docs/RESEARCH-*.md
docs/PROBLEM-STATEMENT-*.md
